<odoo>
  <template id="student_fees_workspace" inherit_id="ideastone_erp.student_workspace" name="Student fees content and navigation">
    <xpath expr="//t[@t-elif=&quot;section == 'fees'&quot;][@t-call]" position="attributes"><attribute name="t-call">ideastone_erp.student_fees_content</attribute></xpath>
    <xpath expr="//nav[hasclass('student_subnav')]/t[@t-elif=&quot;section == 'fees'&quot;]" position="replace"><t t-elif="section == 'fees'"><a href="#student_fees_overview">Overview</a><a href="#student_fee_ledger">Fee details</a><a href="#student_receipts">Payment history &amp; receipts</a><a href="#student_fee_aid">Scholarships &amp; concessions</a></t></xpath>
  </template>
  <template id="student_fees_content" name="Student Fees and Payments">
    <t t-set="f" t-value="d['fees']"/><t t-set="u" t-value="d['fee_ui']"/>
    <div class="fee_view">
      <section id="student_fees_overview" data-fee-page="overview">
        <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Fees &amp; Payments</h1><p>Understand your assessed fees, due dates, posted payments and official receipts in one place.</p></div><span class="pill"><i class="fa fa-calendar-o" aria-hidden="true"/> <t t-esc="d['placement']['year']"/> · <t t-esc="d['placement']['section']"/></span></div>
        <div class="fee-summary"><article class="balance-card" t-att-data-currency="f['symbol']"><div class="label">Outstanding balance · Posted college ledger</div><div class="amount" t-esc="money(f['due']) if f['recorded'] else 'Not recorded'"/><p>Review your fee ledger and due dates. Pay only through payment methods officially approved by the college.</p><div class="balance-meta"><div><span>Total assessed</span><strong t-esc="money(f['assessed']) if f['recorded'] else 'Not recorded'"/></div><div><span>Settled / paid</span><strong t-esc="money(f['paid']) if f['recorded'] else 'Not recorded'"/></div><div><span>Next due date</span><strong t-esc="u['next_due']"/></div></div></article><div class="mini-stats"><article class="mini-stat"><div class="label">Current academic year</div><div class="amount" t-esc="d['placement']['year']"/><div class="foot">Academic period on record</div></article><article class="mini-stat"><div class="label">Payment status</div><div t-att-class="'amount status-amount tone-' + u['tone']" t-esc="u['status']"/><div class="foot" t-esc="'Balance remains outstanding' if f['due'] else 'No outstanding balance in the posted ledger' if f['recorded'] else 'Awaiting a posted fee assessment'"/></article><article class="mini-stat"><div class="label">Receipts available</div><div class="amount" t-esc="len(u['payments'])"/><div class="foot">Official receipt documents, including reversals</div></article><article class="mini-stat"><div class="label">Pending verification</div><div class="amount status-amount">Not tracked</div><div class="foot">Contact accounts for unposted payment attempts</div></article></div></div>
        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Fee breakdown</h2><p class="section-note">Posted invoices and their actual settled amounts. Each card represents an invoice.</p></div><a class="btn" href="#student_fee_ledger">View fee details →</a></div><div t-if="u['invoices']" class="fee-heads"><article t-foreach="u['invoices'][:5]" t-as="i" class="fee-head"><div class="head-top"><h3 t-esc="i['heads'] or i['name']"/><span t-att-class="'badge tone-' + i['tone']" t-esc="i['status']"/></div><div class="fee-amount" t-esc="money(i['total'])"/><div class="status-line"><t t-esc="money(i['paid'])"/> settled · <t t-esc="money(i['balance'])"/> balance</div><div class="track"><span t-att-style="'width: ' + str(i['progress']) + '%'"/></div><p><t t-esc="i['name']"/> · <t t-esc="i['year']"/></p></article><article class="fee-head adjustments"><div class="head-top"><h3>Fee adjustments</h3><span t-att-class="'badge ' + ('done' if u['concession'] else 'neutral')" t-esc="'Posted' if u['concession'] else 'If applicable'"/></div><div class="fee-amount" t-esc="money(u['concession'])"/><div class="status-line">Invoice discounts / concessions</div><p>Already reflected in net assessed amounts. Scholarship awards are not inferred from invoice discounts.</p></article></div><p t-else="" class="empty-state">No posted fee ledger is recorded for your account.</p></section>
        <div class="grid2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Upcoming dues</h2><a class="btn" href="#student_fee_ledger">View all</a></div><div t-foreach="u['dues'][:4]" t-as="i" class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title" t-esc="i['heads'] or i['name']"/><div class="due-sub">Due <t t-esc="i['due_date'] or 'date not assigned'"/> · <t t-esc="i['year']"/></div></div><div class="due-value"><t t-esc="money(i['balance'])"/><small><span t-att-class="'badge ' + ('tone-bad' if i['overdue'] else 'pending')" t-esc="'Overdue' if i['overdue'] else 'Outstanding'"/></small></div></div><p t-if="not u['dues']" class="empty-state" t-esc="'No outstanding dues are recorded.' if f['recorded'] else 'Dues will appear after the accounts office posts a fee assessment.'"/></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Recent payment activity</h2><a class="btn" href="#student_receipts">View history →</a></div><div class="timeline"><article t-foreach="u['payments'][:3]" t-as="p" class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-date" t-esc="p['date']"/><div t-att-class="'timeline-dot ' + ('reversed' if p['status'] == 'Reversed' else '')"/><div class="timeline-body"><strong><t t-esc="p['method_label']"/> payment <t t-esc="p['status'].lower()"/></strong><p><t t-esc="money(p['amount'])"/> · Receipt <t t-esc="p['reference']"/></p></div></article></div><p t-if="not u['payments']" class="empty-state">No official payment receipts have been recorded.</p></section></div>
        <t t-call="ideastone_erp.student_fee_payment_notice"/>
      </section>

      <section id="student_fee_ledger" data-fee-page="details" hidden="hidden"><div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Fee details</h1><p>Review assessed charges, posted discounts, due dates and outstanding balances across all academic periods.</p></div><span class="pill">Academic year <t t-esc="d['placement']['year']"/></span></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>My fee ledger</h2><p class="section-note">Balance = net assessed − settled amount. Discounts are already included in net assessed.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn" data-fee-print="">Print ledger</button></div><div class="filters"><label class="field">Academic period<select data-fee-filter="year"><option value="all">All periods</option><option t-foreach="u['periods']" t-as="year" t-att-value="year" t-esc="year"/></select></label><label class="field">Payment status<select data-fee-filter="status"><option value="all">All statuses</option><option>Paid</option><option>Partially paid</option><option>Outstanding</option></select></label><div class="filter-actions"><button type="button" class="btn primary" data-fee-apply="details">Apply</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-fee-reset="details">Reset</button></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Invoice / fee head</th><th scope="col">Academic period</th><th scope="col">Net assessed</th><th scope="col">Discount / concession</th><th scope="col">Settled</th><th scope="col">Balance</th><th scope="col">Due date</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr t-foreach="u['invoices']" t-as="i" class="fee_ledger_row" t-att-data-year="i['year']" t-att-data-status="i['status']"><td><strong t-esc="i['heads'] or i['name']"/><small t-esc="i['name']"/></td><td><t t-esc="i['year']"/><small t-esc="i['programme']"/></td><td t-esc="money(i['total'])"/><td t-esc="money(i['concession'])"/><td t-esc="money(i['paid'])"/><td><strong t-esc="money(i['balance'])"/></td><td t-esc="i['due_date'] or 'Not assigned'"/><td><span t-att-class="'badge tone-' + i['tone']" t-esc="i['status']"/><small t-if="i['overdue']" class="overdue">Overdue</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="empty-state" data-fee-empty="details" t-att-hidden="'hidden' if u['invoices'] else None" t-esc="'No fee records match these filters.' if u['invoices'] else 'No posted fee ledger is recorded for your account.'"/></section><div class="grid2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>How fee amounts are calculated</h2></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Posted invoice total</div><div class="due-sub">Includes invoice taxes and approved discounts</div></div><div class="due-value">Net assessed</div></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Invoice discounts / concessions</div><div class="due-sub">Shown separately for reference; already included above</div></div><div class="due-value">No second deduction</div></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Settled amount</div><div class="due-sub">Posted payments and accounting adjustments</div></div><div class="due-value">Net − balance</div></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Outstanding balance</div><div class="due-sub">Current amount remaining on the posted invoice</div></div><div class="due-value">Amount due</div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Need a correction?</h2></div><p class="support-copy">Contact the accounts office with your student ID, invoice number, academic period and supporting documents if a fee head, amount, due date or concession looks incorrect.</p><a class="btn light" t-att-href="student_url_for('requests')">Request fee clarification</a></section></div><t t-call="ideastone_erp.student_fee_payment_notice"/></section>

      <section id="student_receipts" data-fee-page="history" hidden="hidden"><div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Payment history &amp; receipts</h1><p>View posted transactions, receipt details, payment references and official proof of payment.</p></div><span class="pill green">Posted records &amp; reversals</span></div><div class="kpis"><article class="kpi green"><span class="kicon"><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div class="kpi-label">Posted payments</div><div class="value" t-esc="u['posted_count']"/><div class="foot">Excludes reversed receipts</div></article><article class="kpi"><span class="kicon"><i class="fa fa-money" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div class="kpi-label">Total posted</div><div class="value" t-esc="money(u['posted_total'])"/><div class="foot">Total of displayed, unreversed receipts</div></article><article class="kpi violet"><span class="kicon"><i class="fa fa-file-text-o" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div class="kpi-label">Receipt documents</div><div class="value" t-esc="len(u['payments'])"/><div class="foot">Includes retained reversal history</div></article><article class="kpi amber"><span class="kicon"><i class="fa fa-clock-o" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div class="kpi-label">Pending verification</div><div class="value">Not tracked</div><div class="foot">Ask accounts about unposted attempts</div></article></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Payment history</h2><p class="section-note">Reversed receipts remain visible as history and are excluded from the total posted above.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn" data-fee-print="">Print history</button></div><div class="filters"><label class="field">Payment method<select data-fee-filter="method"><option value="all">All methods</option><option t-foreach="u['methods']" t-as="method" t-att-value="method" t-esc="method"/></select></label><label class="field">Receipt / reference<input data-fee-filter="search" placeholder="Search receipt number" type="search"/></label><div class="filter-actions"><button type="button" class="btn primary" data-fee-apply="history">Apply</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-fee-reset="history">Reset</button></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Receipt no.</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Amount</th><th scope="col">Method / reference</th><th scope="col">Verification</th><th scope="col">Document</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr t-foreach="u['payments']" t-as="p" class="fee_receipt_row" t-att-data-method="p['method_label']"><td><strong t-esc="p['reference']"/></td><td t-esc="p['date']"/><td><strong t-esc="money(p['amount'])"/></td><td><t t-esc="p['method_label']"/><small t-esc="p['transaction']"/></td><td><span t-att-class="'badge ' + ('tone-bad' if p['status'] == 'Reversed' else 'done')" t-esc="p['status']"/></td><td><a class="btn light" t-att-href="p['url']">Download receipt</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="empty-state" data-fee-empty="history" t-att-hidden="'hidden' if u['payments'] else None" t-esc="'No receipts match your search.' if u['payments'] else 'No official payment receipts have been recorded.'"/></section><div class="grid2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Receipt checklist</h2></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Student name and enrolment</div><div class="due-sub">Must match your official student record.</div></div><span class="badge done">Required</span></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Receipt number and date</div><div class="due-sub">Use these when contacting accounts.</div></div><span class="badge done">Required</span></div><div class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title">Amount and payment reference</div><div class="due-sub">Confirm the details before storing your receipt.</div></div><span class="badge done">Required</span></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Payment not reflected?</h2></div><p class="support-copy">Keep your transaction reference and payment date. Contact accounts for verification before making another payment; a bank debit may not yet be reflected in the college ledger.</p><a class="btn light" t-att-href="student_url_for('requests')">Request payment verification</a></section></div><div class="notice"><span class="notice-icon"><i class="fa fa-info" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div><strong>Official receipt documents</strong><p>Receipt links serve secured PDFs from the college accounting system. Use the recorded receipt status when checking payment history.</p></div></div></section>

      <section id="student_fee_aid" data-fee-page="aid" hidden="hidden"><div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Scholarships &amp; concessions</h1><p>Review posted fee adjustments and find guidance on financial assistance.</p></div><span class="pill violet">Student financial support</span></div><div class="grid2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>My assistance applications</h2><p class="section-note">Only verified awards posted to the ledger reduce the payable fee.</p></div><a class="btn primary" t-att-href="student_url_for('requests')">Ask about assistance</a></div><div class="empty-state"><span class="empty-icon"><i class="fa fa-folder-open-o" aria-hidden="true"/></span>Scholarship application tracking is not configured in this portal. Contact the scholarship cell for available schemes, eligibility and application status.</div><h3>Posted discounts &amp; concessions</h3><div t-foreach="u['adjustments']" t-as="i" class="due-row"><div><div class="due-title" t-esc="i['heads'] or i['name']"/><div class="due-sub"><t t-esc="i['year']"/> · <t t-esc="i['name']"/></div></div><div class="due-value"><t t-esc="money(i['concession'])"/><small><span class="badge done">Posted in invoice</span></small></div></div><p t-if="not u['adjustments']" class="empty-state">No invoice discounts or concessions are posted.</p></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Application process</h2><span class="pill amber">General guidance</span></div><div class="timeline"><article class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-date">Step 1</div><div class="timeline-dot"/><div class="timeline-body"><strong>Confirm the scheme</strong><p>Ask the scholarship cell about eligibility and current deadlines.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-date">Step 2</div><div class="timeline-dot guide"/><div class="timeline-body"><strong>Prepare supporting documents</strong><p>Submit only documents required by the official scheme.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-date">Step 3</div><div class="timeline-dot neutral"/><div class="timeline-body"><strong>College verification</strong><p>The scholarship cell or accounts office verifies the application.</p></div></article><article class="timeline-row"><div class="timeline-date">Step 4</div><div class="timeline-dot neutral"/><div class="timeline-body"><strong>Decision and ledger update</strong><p>Approved adjustments appear after official posting.</p></div></article></div></section></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Documents checklist</h2><span class="subtle small">Requirements vary by scheme</span></div><div class="resource-cards"><article class="resource-card"><span class="resource-icon"><i class="fa fa-id-card-o" aria-hidden="true"/></span><h3>Student identity</h3><p>College ID, enrolment details and valid identity documents if requested.</p><span class="badge done">Basic information</span></article><article class="resource-card"><span class="resource-icon"><i class="fa fa-money" aria-hidden="true"/></span><h3>Income evidence</h3><p>A current income certificate or other proof required by the scholarship authority.</p><span class="badge pending">Check requirement</span></article><article class="resource-card"><span class="resource-icon"><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"/></span><h3>Academic / bank details</h3><p>Marksheets, bank proof or scheme-specific forms where applicable.</p><span class="badge pending">Check requirement</span></article></div></section><div class="notice"><span class="notice-icon"><i class="fa fa-info" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div><strong>Important</strong><p>Eligibility, deadlines, documents and benefit amounts depend on official scheme notifications. Invoice discounts do not establish scholarship approval.</p></div></div></section>
    </div>
  </template>
  <template id="student_fee_payment_notice"><div class="notice"><span class="notice-icon"><i class="fa fa-info" aria-hidden="true"/></span><div><strong>Payment safety &amp; records</strong><p>Online payment is not enabled through an approved college gateway. Contact the accounts office to pay. Posted payments and accounting adjustments determine your ledger balance; keep official receipts for your records.</p></div></div></template>
</odoo>
